ass='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja461:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja461:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja461:9.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja461:9.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja461:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja461:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja461:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja461:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja461:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja461:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja461:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja461:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja461:12.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja461:12.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja461:12.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja461:12.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja461:13.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja461:13.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja461:13.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja461:13.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja461:14.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja461:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja461:0.2": "Ekādasakanipāta ", "ja461:0.3": "Mātuposakavagga ", "ja461:0.4": "7. Dasarathajātaka ", "ja461:1.1": "“Etha lakkhaṇa sītā ca, ", "ja461:1.2": "ubho otarathodakaṁ; ", "ja461:1.3": "Evāyaṁ bharato āha, ", "ja461:1.4": "‘rājā dasaratho mato’”. ", "ja461:2.1": "“Kena rāmappabhāvena, ", "ja461:2.2": "socitabbaṁ na socasi; ", "ja461:2.3": "Pitaraṁ kālakataṁ sutvā, ", "ja461:2.4": "na taṁ pasahate dukhaṁ”. ", "ja461:3.1": "“Yaṁ na sakkā nipāletuṁ, ", "ja461:3.2": "posena lapataṁ bahuṁ; ", "ja461:3.3": "Sa kissa viññū medhāvī, ", "ja461:3.4": "attānamupatāpaye. ", "ja461:4.1": "Daharā ca hi vuddhā ca, ", "ja461:4.2": "ye bālā ye ca paṇḍitā; ", "ja461:4.3": "Aḍḍhā ceva daliddā ca, ", "ja461:4.4": "sabbe maccuparāyaṇā. ", "ja461:5.1": "Phalānamiva pakkānaṁ, ", "ja461:5.2": "niccaṁ patanato bhayaṁ; ", "ja461:5.3": "Evaṁ jātāna maccānaṁ, ", "ja461:5.4": "nicca maraṇato bhayaṁ. ", "ja461:6.1": "Sāyameke na dissanti, ", "ja461:6.2": "pāto diṭṭhā bahujjanā; ", "ja461:6.3": "Pāto eke na dissanti, ", "ja461:6.4": "sāyaṁ diṭṭhā bahujjanā. ", "ja461:7.1": "Paridevayamāno ce, ", "ja461:7.2": "kiñcidatthaṁ udabbahe; ", "ja461:7.3": "Sammūḷho hiṁsamattānaṁ, ", "ja461:7.4": "kayirā taṁ vicakkhaṇo. ", "ja461:8.1": "Kiso vivaṇṇo bhavati, ", "ja461:8.2": "hiṁsamattānamattano; ", "ja461:8.3": "Na tena petā pālenti, ", "ja461:8.4": "niratthā paridevanā. ", "ja461:9.1": "Yathā saraṇamādittaṁ, ", "ja461:9.2": "vārinā parinibbaye; ", "ja461:9.3": "Evampi dhīro sutavā, ", "ja461:9.4": "medhāvī paṇḍito naro; ", "ja461:9.5": "Khippamuppatitaṁ sokaṁ, ", "ja461:9.6": "vāto tūlaṁva dhaṁsaye. ", "ja461:10.1": "Macco ekova acceti, ", "ja461:10.2": "ekova jāyate kule; ", "ja461:10.3": "Saṁyogaparamā tveva, ", "ja461:10.4": "sambhogā sabbapāṇinaṁ. ", "ja461:11.1": "Tasmā hi dhīrassa bahussutassa, ", "ja461:11.2": "Sampassato lokamimaṁ parañca; ", "ja461:11.3": "Aññāya dhammaṁ hadayaṁ manañca, ", "ja461:11.4": "Sokā mahantāpi na tāpayanti. ", "ja461:12.1": "Sohaṁ dassañca bhokkhañca, ", "ja461:12.2": "bharissāmi ca ñātake; ", "ja461:12.3": "Sesañca pālayissāmi, ", "ja461:12.4": "kiccametaṁ vijānato. ", "ja461:13.1": "Dasa vassasahassāni, ", "ja461:13.2": "saṭṭhi vassasatāni ca; ", "ja461:13.3": "Kambugīvo mahābāhu, ", "ja461:13.4": "rāmo rajjamakārayī”ti. ", "ja461:14.1": "Dasarathajātakaṁ sattamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja461:0.1": "", "ja461:0.2": "", "ja461:0.3": "", "ja461:0.4": "", "ja461:1.1": "", "ja461:1.2": "", "ja461:1.3": "", "ja461:1.4": "", "ja461:2.1": "", "ja461:2.2": "", "ja461:2.3": "kālakataṁ → kālaṅkataṁ (mr) ", "ja461:2.4": "", "ja461:3.1": "", "ja461:3.2": "", "ja461:3.3": "", "ja461:3.4": "", "ja461:4.1": "hi vuddhā ca → ye vuddhā (bj); ye vuḍḍhā (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja461:4.2": "", "ja461:4.3": "", "ja461:4.4": "", "ja461:5.1": "", "ja461:5.2": "", "ja461:5.3": "", "ja461:5.4": "", "ja461:6.1": "", "ja461:6.2": "", "ja461:6.3": "", "ja461:6.4": "", "ja461:7.1": "", "ja461:7.2": "", "ja461:7.3": "", "ja461:7.4": "", "ja461:8.1": "", "ja461:8.2": "hiṁsamattānamattano → … mattanā (bj snp3.8:997 [Sallasutta]) ", "ja461:8.3": "", "ja461:8.4": "", "ja461:9.1": "", "ja461:9.2": "parinibbaye → vārināva nibbāpaye (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja461:9.3": "", "ja461:9.4": "", "ja461:9.5": "", "ja461:9.6": "", "ja461:10.1": "ekova → ekova macco (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja461:10.2": "", "ja461:10.3": "", "ja461:10.4": "", "ja461:11.1": "", "ja461:11.2": "", "ja461:11.3": "", "ja461:11.4": "", "ja461:12.1": "", "ja461:12.2": "bharissāmi ca → bhariyāpi ca (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja461:12.3": "", "ja461:12.4": "kiccametaṁ → kiccamevaṁ (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja461:13.1": "", "ja461:13.2": "", "ja461:13.3": "", "ja461:13.4": "", "ja461:14.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja461:0.1": "", "ja461:0.2": "", "ja461:0.3": "", "ja461:0.4": "", "ja461:1.1": "dr27.315, ms22J_2196, msdiv84, ndp22.229, pts-vp-pli4.126, sya27.317", "ja461:1.2": "", "ja461:1.3": "", "ja461:1.4": "", "ja461:2.1": "ms22J_2197, msdiv85", "ja461:2.2": "", "ja461:2.3": "", "ja461:2.4": "", "ja461:3.1": "ms22J_2198, msdiv86", "ja461:3.2": "", "ja461:3.3": "", "ja461:3.4": "", "ja461:4.1": "csp1ed22.237, csp2ed22.237, ms22J_2199, msdiv87, pts-vp-pli4.127, vri68.185", "ja461:4.2": "", "ja461:4.3": "", "ja461:4.4": "", "ja461:5.1": "ms22J_2200, msdiv88", "ja461:5.2": "", "ja461:5.3": "", "ja461:5.4": "", "ja461:6.1": "ms22J_2201, msdiv89", "ja461:6.2": "", "ja461:6.3": "", "ja461:6.4": "", "ja461:7.1": "ms22J_2202, msdiv90", "ja461:7.2": "", "ja461:7.3": "", "ja461:7.4": "", "ja461:8.1": "ms22J_2203, msdiv91", "ja461:8.2": "", "ja461:8.3": "", "ja461:8.4": "", "ja461:9.1": "bj30.406, ms22J_2204, msdiv92", "ja461:9.2": "", "ja461:9.3": "", "ja461:9.4": "", "ja461:9.5": "", "ja461:9.6": "", "ja461:10.1": "dr27.316, ms22J_2205, msdiv93, sya27.318", "ja461:10.2": "", "ja4